 <h3><u>Umr bhar royi sakina</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye sakina ki ghareebi..(2)<br> baap ko khwaab mein dekha to pukari dukhtar<br> aap jis din se gaye..(2)<br> aye mere mazloom padar<br> phir iske baad kaha'n soyi sakina<br> umr bhar royi sakina..(2)<br> phir iske baad kaha'n soyi sakina, baba<br> umr bhar royi sakina..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Aap maqtal ko sidhare to hui khaak basar<br> raakh sab khaime hue jalke phuphi bechadar<br> tumne pehnaye the jo..(2)<br> le gaya zalim wo gauhar<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>2. Bhoolna chaha bhi lekin na bhula payi wo baat<br> naqsh is dil pe hue hai wo sukoo ke lamhaat<br> aapke seene pe mai..(2)<br> soyi thi ashoor ki raat<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>3. Mere rukhsaar pe dekho to tamacho'n ke nishaa'n<br> aankh se ashk to kaano se lahu bhi hai rawaa'n<br> aapke sar ki qasam..(2)<br> qaidi hui jab se yahan<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>4. Baba hum gyarah(11) moharram ko safar par nikle<br> shaam ki samt sabhi qaidi chale rote hue<br> kaise batlau tumhe..(2)<br> raah mein jo zakhm mile<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>5. Chalte naaqe se mai ek baar giri mehwe fugha'n<br> qafila roka gaya qaidi hue nauha kuna<br> dadi zehra se mili..(2)<br> soyi thi kuch der wahan<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>6. Baba ek ye bhi qayamat ka sitam tha hum par<br> shaam ke logo ne barsaye the hum par patthar<br> pattharo se jo lage..(2)<br> zakhm dile nazuk par<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>7. Tees ghanto ka safar wo bhi aseeri ki liye<br> phir bulaya mujhe zalim ne kaneezi ke liye<br> ye sitam kam to nahi..(2)<br> aap ki beti ke liye<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>8. Aap ki yaad, tamacho ke sitam, tanhai<br> dekho taqdeer sakina ko kahan le aayi<br> baba jis roz se mai..(2)<br> qaid e sitam mein aayi<br> phir iske baad...</p> 
  <p>9. Bayn irfan sakina ke likhe kya mazhar<br> baap ko khwab mein dekha to pukari dukhtar<br> aap jis din se gaye..(2)<br> aye mere mazloom padar<br> phir iske baad kaha'n soyi sakina, baba</p> 
